<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="523001618"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1247950420"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Jealous"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Faustix"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Faustix"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:43.423"><div begin="00:00.000" end="03:35.979"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:04.293" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I don't know why I get paranoid when she's here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不明白 为何她在我身边我会变得偏执</span></p><p begin="00:05.334" end="00:08.956" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">I guess it's alright as long as you keep me near<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想只要你与我紧紧相依就会安然无恙</span></p><p begin="00:08.956" end="00:13.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">I know that a coffee stain is showin', and I feel insane<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道咖啡污渍慢慢显现 我快要抓狂</span></p><p begin="00:14.303" end="00:19.336" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">You might think I'm alright, that's alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可能觉得我一切安好没关系</span></p><p begin="00:19.336" end="00:26.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I heard she made you smile<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听说她让你笑颜绽放</span></p><p begin="00:27.921" end="00:29.313" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Did you know? Did you know?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否知道 你是否知道</span></p><p begin="00:29.313" end="00:35.022" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I read in every time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当我试着理解你</span></p><p begin="00:35.022" end="00:38.889" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">She's always on my mind, I can't let it go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她的身影浮现在我脑海里</span></p><p begin="00:38.889" end="00:41.182" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Hate that we're sleepin' on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我讨厌你睡在她带回家的枕头上</span></p><p begin="00:41.182" end="00:43.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">The pillow that she brought home</p><p begin="00:43.727" end="00:46.348" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">From that time you were in Rome<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从那时起 你误入歧途</span></p><p begin="00:46.348" end="00:48.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">I wish I didn't know that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多么希望我一无所知</span></p><p begin="00:48.900" end="00:51.282" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">You wear the same perfume<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你和她用着同款香水</span></p><p begin="00:51.282" end="00:53.976" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">She went and got for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她完完全全地拥有你</span></p><p begin="00:54.469" end="00:59.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I'm only jealous 'cause you let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是嫉妒 因为你让我忿忿不平</span></p><p begin="01:07.087" end="01:09.406" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">'Cause you let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你让我忿忿不平</span></p><p begin="01:14.579" end="01:19.042" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">I'm only jealous 'cause you let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是嫉妒 因为你让我忿忿不平</span></p><p begin="01:19.147" end="01:22.377" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">No lie, I thought you were mine alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说实话 我以为你心里只有我一人</span></p><p begin="01:23.146" end="01:27.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">But I know her style, and she won't let you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我了解她的行事风格 她不会让你离开</span></p><p begin="01:27.378" end="01:32.017" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">You tell me that it's in my head, and I'm wastin' every breath<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我说的话烙印在我的脑海里</span></p><p begin="01:33.018" end="01:37.623" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Tryna make it alright, but isn't that alright?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我试着让一切好起来 难道这样不好么</span></p><p begin="01:37.565" end="01:45.561" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">I heard she made you smile<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听说她让你笑颜绽放</span></p><p begin="01:45.561" end="01:47.618" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Did you know? Did you know?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否知道 你是否知道</span></p><p begin="01:47.618" end="01:53.055" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">I read in every time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当我试着理解你</span></p><p begin="01:53.055" end="01:57.284" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">She's always on my mind, I can't let it go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她的身影浮现在我脑海里</span></p><p begin="01:57.284" end="01:59.543" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Hate that we're sleepin' on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我讨厌你睡在她带回家的枕头上</span></p><p begin="01:59.543" end="02:01.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">The pillow that she brought home</p><p begin="02:02.268" end="02:04.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">From that time you were in Rome<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从那时起 你误入歧途</span></p><p begin="02:04.669" end="02:07.084" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I wish I didn't know that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多么希望我一无所知</span></p><p begin="02:07.036" end="02:09.568" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">You wear the same perfume<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你和她用着同款香水</span></p><p begin="02:09.568" end="02:12.766" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">She went and got for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她完完全全地拥有你</span></p><p begin="02:13.039" end="02:17.664" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">I'm only jealous 'cause you let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是嫉妒 因为你让我忿忿不平</span></p><p begin="02:23.705" end="02:27.675" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">(I'm only jealous) 'Cause you let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是嫉妒</span></p><p begin="02:29.004" end="02:30.706" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">(You let me, let me)</p><p begin="02:32.130" end="02:37.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">(Oh) I'm only jealous 'cause you let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是嫉妒 因为你让我忿忿不平</span></p><p begin="02:36.606" end="02:38.663" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Hate that we're sleepin' on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我讨厌你睡在她带回家的枕头上</span></p><p begin="02:38.663" end="02:41.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">The pillow that she brought home</p><p begin="02:41.308" end="02:43.876" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">From that time you were in Rome<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从那时起 你误入歧途</span></p><p begin="02:43.876" end="02:46.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">I wish I didn't know that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多么希望我一无所知</span></p><p begin="02:46.548" end="02:48.563" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">You wear the same perfume<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你和她用着同款香水</span></p><p begin="02:48.870" end="02:51.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">She went and got for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她完完全全地拥有你</span></p><p begin="02:52.307" end="02:56.761" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">I'm only jealous 'cause you let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是嫉妒 因为你让我忿忿不平</span></p><p begin="03:04.490" end="03:07.868" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">'Cause you let me (Me)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你让我忿忿不平</span></p><p begin="03:11.184" end="03:16.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">I'm only jealous 'cause you let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是嫉妒 因为你让我忿忿不平</span></p><p begin="03:16.650" end="03:18.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Yeah, you let me, let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我忿忿不平</span></p><p begin="03:19.150" end="03:21.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Yeah, you let me be jealous<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我变得嫉妒</span></p><p begin="03:21.400" end="03:23.822" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">Yeah, you let me, let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我忿忿不平</span></p><p begin="03:23.822" end="03:26.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Yeah, you let me be jealous<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我变得嫉妒</span></p><p begin="03:26.237" end="03:28.737" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">Yeah, you let me, let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我忿忿不平</span></p><p begin="03:28.737" end="03:31.064" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Yeah, you let me be jealous<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我变得嫉妒</span></p><p begin="03:31.064" end="03:35.979" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">I'm only jealous 'cause you let me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是嫉妒 因为你让我忿忿不平</span></p></div></body></tt>